<BaseLayout breadcrumbLabel="Measurement" title="CMM programming and automated measurement for mould making | PCam" description="PCamMMS programs CNC coordinate measuring machines from solid models and supports automated electrode and workpiece inspection workflows.">
<SolutionDetail eyebrow="Measurement" title="Make inspection part of the automated process." lead="Program CMM work from the solid model and connect measurement to electrode, workpiece and production workflows." problem="Small batches make manual CMM programming disproportionately expensive." approach="PCamMMS reduces measurement preparation to defining the required points and features on the model, then manages the measurement cycle and reporting. In automated cells, inspection can become another controlled production step instead of a disconnected queue." bullets={['STEP solid import','Visual CAD programming of measurement cycles','Geometry and surface measurement','Graphical error representation and reports','Electrode preset and quality control','Workpiece preset and quality control']} productSlugs={['pcammms','pcamcell','pcammes']} architecture={[{title:'CAD / solid model',text:'Nominal geometry and inspection intent'},{title:'PCamMMS',text:'Measurement path and feature logic'},{title:'CMM',text:'Automated measurement execution'},{title:'Production flow',text:'Results linked to workpiece/electrode state'}]} seoTitle="CMM measurement" />
</BaseLayout>
